<title>UK: BZW sets call warrants on STET.</title>
<headline>BZW sets call warrants on STET.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd has issued 50 million American-style call warrants, on STET savings shares, lead manager BZW Securities Ltd said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    6,500.00 ITL	    ISS PRICE    830.00 ITL</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   28.JAN.98		 PAYDATE	18.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  6,208.00 ITL</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
